Subject: webrtc: forward the candidate address override to renderers

Patch 0073 reads --fingerprint-webrtc-ip in the process that serialises a
candidate, which for the SDP is the renderer. The browser's own command line is
not inherited by a renderer, so without this the switch was read in the browser
and nowhere else and the SDP kept the original address.

This forwards it in AppendRendererCommandLine, which runs for every renderer
including ones spawned later in the session, so the value cannot differ between
two frames of the same launch.

It carries the same limitation as 0073 and for the same reason: it moves a
string into the process that writes the SDP, and changes nothing about which
interface a datagram leaves from. The address a remote peer reads off an
arriving packet is still whatever the socket was bound to. Patch 0086 is what
makes the two agree, by relaying WebRTC's UDP through the configured SOCKS5
proxy or refusing to create the socket at all.

The declaration is indented to match the function it sits in; the original
version of this patch introduced it at column zero.

diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
index c905e5535e..b9e3a809fe 100644
--- a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
+++ b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
@@ -3746,6 +3746,14 @@ void RenderProcessHostImpl::AppendRendererCommandLine(
         switches::kGpuClientId, base::NumberToString(gpu_client_->client_id()));
   }
 
+  const base::CommandLine& browser_cmd =
+      *base::CommandLine::ForCurrentProcess();
+  if (browser_cmd.HasSwitch("fingerprint-webrtc-ip")) {
+    command_line->AppendSwitchASCII(
+        "fingerprint-webrtc-ip",
+        browser_cmd.GetSwitchValueASCII("fingerprint-webrtc-ip"));
+  }
+
   // Call this as early as possible so that --extension-process will show early
   // in process listings. See https://crbug.com/1211558 for details.
   GetContentClient()->browser()->AppendExtraCommandLineSwitches(
